{"about_the_game":"He started out as an unknown person in the rivers and lakes, but with a humble body, he became a hero in the treacherous rivers and lakes disputes and stirred up the general trend of the world.<br><br>No levels, no professions, hundreds of martial arts combinations, dozens of secret scrolls, talents, special attainments, unlimited choices, high degree of freedom, self-created schools, and self-established masters.<br><br>A dynamically evolving open world, unique interpersonal relationships, experiences, thousands of randomly generated NPCs in the rivers and lakes, intrigues, companionship in the mortal world, and adventures.<br><br>There are more than 500,000 words of plot text. Every choice will plant the seeds of the future in the world. Good luck and misfortune, what reward is there?<br><br>Real-time combat, horizontal action, Jianghu martial arts, sect martial arts, secret martial arts, more than ten kinds of weapons, the use of inner strength, the growth of posture, the true energy to defeat the enemy, pure Jianghu, real experience.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/\u592a\u548c.gif?t=1742443344\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/\u8239\u5e2e.gif?t=1742443344\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/\u51cc\u9e3f\u5251\u52bf.gif?t=1742443344\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/\u9189\u996e\u964d\u9f99\u65e0\u53cc\u5f0f.gif?t=1742443344\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361680/extras/\u6ca7\u6d77\u89c2\u6f9c\u5200\u6cd5.gif?t=1742443344\" />","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u9752\u840d\u8bc6\u6b66","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamst